@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@userToken = replace-with-customer-jwt
@orderId = replace-with-order-object-id

### Get configured checkout methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/options

### Start a hosted checkout for the authenticated customer's order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### VNPay browser return (invalid signature example)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/vnpay/return?vnp_TxnRef={{orderId}}&vnp_SecureHash=invalid

### VNPay IPN (invalid signature example)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/vnpay/ipn?vnp_TxnRef={{orderId}}&vnp_SecureHash=invalid

### ZaloPay callback (invalid signature example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/zalopay/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "{}",
  "mac": "invalid",
  "type": 1
}
